OL,3,GNEWSAFears outdoor gym plan could be
OL,4,Arevived
OL,5,
OL,6,FPark volunteers fear a previously
OL,7,Fscrapped outdoor gym could be revived
OL,8,Fafter council communication said the
OL,9,F"idea is still there".
OL,11,FThe scheme, for the former Elvet
OL,12,Fbowling green near Durham city centre,
OL,13,Fwas dropped last year amid outrage from
OL,14,Fresidents and "inconclusive" results
OL,15,Ffrom a consultation.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
