OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1795245988
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFears outdoor gym plan could be
OL,4,Arevived
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut an internal Durham County Council
OL,7,Freview, carried out at the request of
OL,8,Fthe Elvet Green Durham group, said the
OL,9,Fproposal remained "at a very early
OL,10,Fstage of development", while a response
OL,11,Fto the local MP's office said the idea
OL,12,F"is still there and might be
OL,13,Frejuvenated at a later date".
OL,15,FThe local authority said there were no
OL,16,Fplans for an outdoor gym at the park.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
